  "_comment": "The deny list is the write guard for the ads part: an unattended run can never change targeting or an ad set, delete, duplicate, touch audiences, rules, catalogs, posts or account slots, even in Auto mode. It assumes the Pipeboard server is named 'pipeboard', as ads/SETUP.md adds it. The check-in needs only update_ad, update_campaign, create_ad_creative, create_existing_post_ad_creative, create_ad, create_video_upload_url, upload_ad_video_file and the read tools; the build adds create_campaign, create_adset and create_ad_rule."
